+<p>
+This also affects summarized search results. The <code>_summary=true</code> response is based on elements marked
+as <a href="elementdefinition-definitions.html#ElementDefinition.isSummary">isSummary</a> in the base resource
+definition. Because profiles cannot change <code>isSummary</code>, a profile that makes an otherwise optional,
+non-summary element mandatory cannot assume that element will appear in <code>_summary=true</code> results; such
+a summary might not conform to the profile.
+</p>
 
 
